<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.8960.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 2.8960.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 2.8960 against the dollar, down from 2.8895 on Wednesday, and at 1.8375 against the mark, up from 1.8385, the NBP said.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
